{"id":"54d630bb92c94299","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-generic-exists.md","title":"0′ 可计算的 1-generic 存在","display":"thm-generic-exists — 0′ 可计算的 1-generic 存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-generic-exists","aliases":["20-thm-generic-exists"],"display":"thm-generic-exists — 0′ 可计算的 1-generic 存在","chapter":"6","section":"6.3.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercises 6.3.3–6.3.4","source_pdf_pages":[172],"source_printed_pages":[138],"depends_on":["[[20-df-1gen]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","[[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]","[[20-thm-1gen-low]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]","[[20-df-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-generic-exists"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-generic-exists</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-exists — 0′ 可计算的 1-generic 存在"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercises 6.3.3–6.3.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6f4e11aea39794a8\" href=\"?note=6f4e11aea39794a8\" title=\"20-thm-generic-biimmune\">20-thm-generic-biimmune</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bc7d5064491f1d37\" href=\"?note=bc7d5064491f1d37\" title=\"20-thm-1gen-low\">20-thm-1gen-low</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 通过固定串编码枚举所有 c.e. 二进制串集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(K\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 为可计算集合族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Low}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Low}_1\\)</span> 采用跳跃定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"6f4e11aea39794a8\" href=\"?note=6f4e11aea39794a8\" title=\"20-thm-generic-biimmune\">20-thm-generic-biimmune</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"bc7d5064491f1d37\" href=\"?note=bc7d5064491f1d37\" title=\"20-thm-1gen-low\">20-thm-1gen-low</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic-exists}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\in2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{1Generic}(G)\\land\nG\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land \\operatorname{set}(G)\\notin\\mathcal R\\land\\operatorname{Low}_1(G)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic-exists}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\in2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{1Generic}(G)\\land\nG\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land \\operatorname{set}(G)\\notin\\mathcal R\\land\\operatorname{Low}_1(G)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_0\\prec\\sigma_1\\prec\\cdots\">\\(\\sigma_0\\prec\\sigma_1\\prec\\cdots\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 询问是否有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma_e\">\\(\\rho\\succeq\\sigma_e\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>；这是统一 c.e. 存在问题，已给定的停机集归约编译器使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 能决定。若有就普通搜索到一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>，若无保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_e\">\\(\\sigma_e\\)</span>；然后补 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{e+1}\">\\(\\sigma_{e+1}\\)</span>。允许非严格延长，故当前串已经在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 的情况也正确被满足。</p>\n<p>长度逐步增加，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\bigcup_e\\sigma_e\">\\(G=\\bigcup_e\\sigma_e\\)</span> 全定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\le_TK\">\\(G\\le_TK\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 在其阶段被碰到，或当前前缀的所有延长都不在其中；后续延长保持相应见证，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是 1-generic。已证明的 generic 双免疫性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 无限且无无限 c.e. 子集，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 不能可计算。GL1 定理和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\le_TK\">\\(G\\le_TK\\)</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 低，恢复 Exercise 6.3.4 的非零低度存在结论。</p>\n<p>Hypothesis 不再把“停机 oracle 可回答延长问题”本身作为额外公理，而是从所列的一一完备性定理导出。普通 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 的互译沿用本书跳跃约定。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 138 / PDF 172。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-1gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolve